===Etymology===
{{sense|New York City}} From {{bor|en|nl||[[nieuw|Nieuw]] [[Haarlem]]|new Haarlem}}, the original name of the area under the Dutch control, after {{m|nl|Haarlem}}, a city in the Netherlands.

